# The frontend needs no build-time API configuration.
#
# All API calls are relative to `/api/v1`, because the browser is always
# same-origin with the API: CloudFront serves both the static site and the
# Lambda in the cloud, and the Vite dev proxy does the same locally.
#
# `bin/deploy-frontend.sh` exports VITE_API_URL and VITE_API_ENDPOINTS during
# the build. We deliberately ignore them — hardcoding the CloudFront hostname
# would break the same-origin cookie model.
